    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bake ba ng'wa Solomoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi Solomoni walī antogilwe ū nke wakwe ū nshīke o ng'wa Falao, alīyo wabikūmbagwa na bakīma bangī; na lūūlū ūtoola bashīke ba batemi gītī ba Bamoabu, Baamoni, Baedomu, Basidoni, na Bahītī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bakīma benaba baalī ba kūfuma mu mahanga ayo SEEBA walī wabahūgūla a Baisilaeli ūbawīla, “Yaya ū kwitolela nabo a benabo, nguno bakūmugalūcha ī ng'holò jing'we mubagalūkīle bamulungu babo.” Alīyo īkī ū Solomoni walī wabikūmvwa a bakīma benabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūyūbatoola dūhū, nose ūbakwīja, ūshisha bakīma magana mpungatī, a bashīke ba batemi, na bangī magana adatū; būngalūcha ī ng'holò yakwe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Solomoni aho waja alīnamhaala, a bake bakwe būngalūcha gete ī ng'holò yakwe, ūbiza nondeeji wa bamulungu bangī, ī ng'holò yakwe yīnga ū mu būshikaanu wa kwifunya ū kūlī SEEBA Mulungu wakwe, gīt'ūmo yalī ng'holò ya ng'wa ise Daūdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandya kūnondeela Ashitoleti, mulungu nkīma wa Basidoni, na Moleki, mulungu wamalofu wa Baamoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Solomoni wīta yabūbi no ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA; oya ū kūnondeela ū SEEBA mu kwifunya kose gīt'ūmo walī ū ise ū Daūdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwimanīla ū Solomoni wabeeja ipandī lya higūlya kūlwa ng'wa Kemoshi, ū mulungu wamalofu wa Bamoabu; na Moleki, ū mulungu wamalofu wa Baamoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ūbīītīla gīko pye dūhū na a bake bakwe a bangī a ba kūfuma kū mahanga ga hanze; būpandīka ha kūzuukīja būbbani na kūfunya shitambò kūlwa nguno ya bamulungu babo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "SEEBA kūmpelanīla Solomoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūmpelanīla no ū Solomoni nguno ī ng'holò yakwe īkagalūka yūneka ū SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli, ūyo walī washisha ng'hangala ibīlī akūng'wilongelaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno nūūlū īkī walī wanemeja ū Solomoni ū kūlondeela bamulungu bangī, alīyo naheene atashidīlīīlile ī shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Solomoni, “Ū mhayo gwenūyū gūlī mu ng'holò yako, na lūūlū īkī walemeelilwe ū kūshidima ī shilagīlo shane na a malange gane gīt'ūmo nakakūlagīīlīla, managa gīkī ū būtemi nakūbūtandūla nakwīngīje, nang'winhe ūmò wa banhū abo balī ha sīlīlī yako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ahene natūgwīta ū mhayo gwenūyū mu shikū ja būpanga wako kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa Daūdi ū so. Nakūng'wīngīja ū ng'witūnja wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nū ng'wene natūng'wīngīja pye gete ū būtemi ū bose, nakūng'winha lūganda lūmò, kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa Daūdi ntūmami wane, na kūlwa nguno ya nzengo gwa Yelusalemu ūyo naagūsola.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Banishi ba ng'wa Solomoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūmūūkīja ū Solomoni ng'wanishi kūfuma mu sī ya Edomu; lina lyakwe Hadadi, munhū wa mu kaya ya ng'wikūlū lya sī ya Edomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makanza gene Daūdi wilwishaga būlūgū nī sī ya Edomu, ū Yoabu ūyo walī ntaale wa mabità akaja koi kūbajīīka abo baalī babūlagwa mu būlūgū, aho alī kwenūko wandya nīmo gwa kūbabūlaga pye a bagosha ū mu sī ya Edomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yoabu na a bashilikale bakwe bikala ko myeji ītandatū, kūshisha būbamala kūbabūlaga pye a bagosha ū mu Edomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shikū jenījo ū Hadadi walī ataalī nyanda ndo, bataale balebe abo baalī batūmami ba būsugi ūbo walī o ng'wa ise būpeelela Misili būnjaana kwenūko nū Hadadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho balīpeela bandīja Midiani ū lūgendo lwabo, būja Palani. Ī Palani nako būsola banhū, hū būja ī Misili; būpeelela kūlī ntemi Falao wa Misili. Ū Falao ūūkang'winha ū Hadadi numba na shilīwa, ūng'winha na malaale ga kūlīma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Falao akantogwa no ū Hadadi, kūshisha ūntooja nzunaye wa nke wakwe Tahapene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nzunaye o ng'wa Tahapene ng'wenūyo ūmyalīla ū Hadadi ng'witūnja ūng'wīnīka ī lina Genubati; ū Genubati ūkūlīla ng'wikūlū hamò na a baana ba ntemi, nguno ū Tahapene akaanelela ng'wikūlū kūshisha ūkūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hadadi aho alī Misili wigwa gīkī ū Daūdi wamalile kūlaala hamò na bataale bakwe, nū Yoabu ū ntaale wa mabità wachiile. Na lūūlū ū Hadadi ūng'wīla ū Falao, “Nizunīlījage lūūlū nane nashoke kaya kū sī ya ng'wise.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Falao ūmūja, “Shakwileba kī ū mu sī īyī, nose ūlīhaya kūja kū sī ya ng'wing'we?” Hadadi nang'hwe ūshosha, “Natilebilwe kīnhū, bebe nizunīlījage dūhū naje.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu walī wamūūkīja ū Solomoni ng'wanishi ūngī; lina lyakwe Lezoni ng'witūnja o ng'wa Eliada. Ū ng'wene walī wampeela ise būgonzo Hadadeza, ūyo walī ntemi wa Zoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A makanza gene Daūdi walwaaga būlūgū na bana Zoba ūbapyena, ū ngosha ng'wenūyo akakuminga ibità lya banhū ūbiza ntongeeji wabo, ūtoloka nabo būūkikala mu sī ya Damasiko, bīsuga ī sī yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū ja būtemi bo ng'wa Solomoni ī jose, ū Lezoni walī ng'wanishi wa sī ya Baisilaeli; ū būbi ūbo wabīītīlaga bongelelejaga a ha būbi ūbo bīītīlagwa na Hadadi. Na lūūlū ū Lezoni aho alī ntemi wa Alamu, walī ng'wanishi ntaale wa Baisilaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeloboamu kūngomela Solomoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walīho ngosha ūmò wa basugi ba mu būtemi bo ng'wa Solomoni, lina lyakwe Yeloboamu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Nebati, nsugi wa Zeleda mu Efulaimu; ū nina witanagwa ī lina lyakwe Zelua, ū ngoshi walī wamala kūzumalīka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī nguno ya kūngomela ū ntemi yalī gīkī, Ū Solomoni walī na nīmo gwa kwīzenga ī Milo, na kūchiba lyoma lyalīho mu ndugu ya nzengo go ng'wa ise Daūdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Yeloboamu walī ngosha apandile hasī ū kū milīmo, ū Solomoni aho wamona ūmo watūmamīlaga ūyega, ūng'wīta kūbiza ntaale wa milīmo y'hadīke kū banhū ba numba ya ng'wa Yosefu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikanza ilebe ū mu shikū jenījo, ū Yeloboamu wajaga hanze ya nzengo gwa Yelusalemu; ng'hangi Ahiya wa Shilo ūmona; ū ng'hangi ng'wenūyo walī na ng'wenda mpya agwigumīīlile; ūng'witana būja būbīlī wabo kwipandī lītī na banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Ahiya ūgūsola ū ng'wenda gwakwe ū mpya ūyo walī agwigumīīlile, ūgūtandagūla shipandī ikūmi na shibīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūng'wīla ū Yeloboamu, “Anukūlaga ī shipandī īsh'ikūmi īshi ūtwaale shibize shako; nguno ū SEEBA ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli alīhaya gīkī, ‘Nakūbūtandūla ū būtemi nawīnje ū mu nkono go ng'wa Solomoni, ū bebe nakwinhe ng'anda ikūmi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo akūsaaja lūganda lūmò kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa Daūdi ntūmami wane, na kūlwa nguno ya nzengo gwa Yelusalemu ūyo nagūsola kūfuma mu ng'anda jose ja Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo gwenūyū nakūgwīta nguno baanilekile ū nene bandya kūnamya Ashiteloti, mulungu nkīma wa Basidoni, na Kemoshi, mulungu wa Bamoabu, na Moleki, mulungu wa Baamoni; batūshimīzīlaga ū mu nzīla jane, nī yīyo ītūngīlīgije mu miso gane batīyītaga, nū mu katongeelele kane boyile ū kūshimīzīla mo, nī nshilagīlo shane batūshidīlīlaga ūmo wītīlaga ū Daūdi ū ise o ng'wa Solomoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū būtemi natūng'wīngīja ū Solomoni ū bose ū mu nkono gwakwe; ū wei nakūneka ho a ha būtemi kūshisha jishile ī shikū ja būpanga wakwe kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa Daūdi ntūmami wane ūyo nansola; ūyo walī ashidimile ī shilagīlo shane na a katongeelele kane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'witūnja wakwe h'ūyo nakūng'wīngīja ū būtemi nakwinhe ng'anda ikūmi ū bebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'witūnja wakwe nakūnekela lūganda lūmò, kūlwa nguno ya ntūmami wane Daūdi; būlī makanza abize na tala īkūbakaga ū kū būtongi wane ū mu Yelusalemu, nzengo ūyo nagūsola kūlwa kūtūūla mo lina lyane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū bebe, nakūkūsola nakwīte ūbize nsugi wa yose īyo ng'holò yako īlī na ng'hūmbū ja kwīpandīka, ūkūbiza ntemi wa Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ūlū wīta pyī īyo nakūkūlagīla, ūshimīzīla mu nzīla jane, wīta īyo yigeleelilwe mu miso gaane, na a katongeelele kane ūūkadima, pyī nī shilagīlo shane; gīt'ūmo wītīlaga Daūdi ntūmami wane, nakūbiza hamò nang'ho. Nī numba nakūkūzengela ya nguzu, ya būdūla wa kūlama makanza malīhu gīt'ūmo nanzengela Daūdi, hama nakūkwinha bebe ī Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Daūdi nakūbagwisīja mayanga kūlwa nguno ya mhayo gwenūyū; gwike īt'ilalī.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Solomoni wandya kūkooba nzīla ya kūmūlaga ū Yeloboamu, alīyo ū Yeloboamu ūpeelela Misili kū ng'wa ntemi Shishaki; wikala kwenūko kūshisha ūcha ū Solomoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūcha kwa ng'wa Solomoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mihayo ī yīngī ī yose ī ya mu shikū ja būtemi bo ng'wa Solomoni, nī yose ī ya mbika ja koolekegeje ka katūmamīle kakwe ka masala; ī yose yenīyo yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha katūmamīle ka ng'wa Solomoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Solomoni walī ntemi wa Isilaeli ī yose ikanza lya myaka makūmi anè; ū wigasho wakwe walī Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 11:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho wifuula na bakūlūgenji bakwe; ūjīkwa mu nzengo go ng'wa ise Daūdi. Ūtema ng'witūnja wakwe Lehoboamu a ha ng'wanya gwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.11.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.11.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
